WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600 line:80% position:50% align:center
Your people and agents
see different truths.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.520 line:80% position:50% align:center
The truth is scattered across
the systems where work happens.

3
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.460 line:80% position:50% align:center
People rebuild it by hand.

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.170 line:80% position:50% align:center
Agents start without it.

5
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.960 line:80% position:50% align:center
Navis turns those signals
into one shared understanding.

6
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.550 line:80% position:50% align:center
Inside a company,
the Navis App is for people.

7
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.240 line:80% position:50% align:center
It shows what changed —
and why it matters.

8
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.400 line:80% position:50% align:center
Every fact has its source,
its time, and how fresh it is.

9
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.050 line:80% position:50% align:center
A person decides.

10
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.680 line:80% position:50% align:center
Then the company acts.

11
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.120 line:80% position:50% align:center
The same company's agents
use Navis Developer.

12
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.620 line:80% position:50% align:center
Connect once — through
MCP, API, SDK or CLI.

13
00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.150 line:80% position:50% align:center
The agent asks —

14
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.480 line:80% position:50% align:center
and gets the company's context,
with sources and freshness.

15
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.750 line:80% position:50% align:center
Navis isn't the model.

16
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.800 line:80% position:50% align:center
It supplies the company's truth.

17
00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.380 line:80% position:50% align:center
The agent does the work,
and the run is on record.

18
00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:57.880 line:80% position:50% align:center
Same facts.

19
00:00:58.210 --> 00:00:59.260 line:80% position:50% align:center
Same sources.

20
00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.710 line:80% position:50% align:center
Same freshness.

21
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.360 line:80% position:50% align:center
One understanding.

22
00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.780 line:80% position:50% align:center
Two ways in.

23
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.270 line:80% position:50% align:center
NavisLabs.

24
00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.420 line:80% position:50% align:center
The shared understanding
for your organization.

